1
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,200
- Come on. Take it off the wall.
- I take it off, right?

2
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,400
- Take it off.
- I’m on it.

3
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:20,760
